# Tater Talk Design System

## Color Palette (CSS Variables)
Always use these CSS custom properties defined in [global.css](mdc:src/styles/global.css):
```css
--color-deep-purple: #1a0b2e    /* Primary background */
--color-electric-blue: #16537e   /* Accents */
--color-bright-cyan: #1dd3b0     /* Highlights */
--color-warm-orange: #ff6b35     /* CTAs */
--color-sound-wave-start: #7209b7 /* Gradient start */
--color-sound-wave-end: #2980b9   /* Gradient end */
--color-microphone-gold: #f39c12  /* Special accents */
```

## Pre-built Utility Classes
- `.gradient-text` - Cyan to orange gradient text
- `.pulse-glow` - Animated glow effect for interactive elements
- `.animated-gradient` - Shifting background gradient
- `.typing-animation` - Typewriter text effect
- `.animate-spin-slow` - Slow rotation animation

## Audio Theme Elements
- **Microphone emoji**: 🎙️ for primary branding
- **Sound wave patterns**: SVG paths in hero and backgrounds
- **Pulse animations**: For microphone buttons and interactive elements
- **Speech-focused copy**: "Talk", "Voice", "Listen", "Speak"

## Component Patterns
- **Gradient backgrounds**: Use `bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-400 to-blue-600`
- **Card hover effects**: Scale and glow on hover
- **Button styles**: Gradient backgrounds with hover scale transforms
- **Section spacing**: `py-24` for major sections
- **Container max-width**: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8`